,"speaker":"AN-94","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let's go, 15. There are still Nytos hiding in the crowd... Our mission isn't over yet."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"202407_Embla","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"Campaion-70","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_weapon_reload","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You have five minutes to say your last words."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Embla","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"12, Shaw was such an extraordinary woman. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"When I was in Avernus, I looked through Paradeus' database... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"AK-15 is the most powerful Doll in the entire world, you know?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I have never doubted that."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Embla","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Shaw created DEFY through sheer mechanical skills. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What the Earl is seeking, what everyone is trying to seize... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Shaw has achieved long ago, and in an utterly different way."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But nobody cared about Shaw or DEFY. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Just as nobody cared about Shaw's model aircraft when she was little."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Embla","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It doesn't matter. Shaw didn't care either."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But you betrayed her. You're no longer purely mechanical."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Embla","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But I've turned into a human just like her. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Compared to \"Nadia\", \"RPK-16\", or \"Pandora\"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I much prefer the name I've given myself—Embla."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tell me, what were you thinking when Ange died?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Embla","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do you want to know so badly? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"See, 12, if I were still a Doll, you could easily hack my neural cloud to access my memory. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But now, I can keep this secret forever."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Embla","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Having lost Ange and me, what will you be fighting for from now on?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...DEFY will not falter here."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Embla","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Shaw, Ange, the Commander... they are all lone wolves. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In the world we live in, those who wade through the thorns alone will eventually perish."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's your point?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Embla","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Laplace once asked Ange a question. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"\"If everything in life is futile, then what is the point in struggling?\" "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What do you think Ange's answer was?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She wouldn't have to answer the question. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Her very existence was the answer itself."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Embla smiles, and for the very first time, it is a genuine smile."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Embla","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AK-12... you'd better outlive us all."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Select","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"30 seconds. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"One last question. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Did you really kill Shaw?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Embla","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Lunasia once asked me whose side I was on. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I said to her, \"Apostate only am I true. I am you, when I am I.\""}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Embla","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You will never find out the answer to that question, 12."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...And I will never forgive you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Embla","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Luckily for me, I don't need forgiveness."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.7","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Crowd_Run","r